{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b A curated playbook of problem-solving and stress-management mnemonics.} Acronyms that compress workflows into actionable steps\u8212-for incidents, RCAs (root cause analysis), design decisions, and high-stress situations.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Note:} This is a {\b field guide/playbook} with opinionated workflows (e.g., STOP \u8594 ? TRACE \u8594 ? DEBUG \u8594 ? 8D) rather than a traditional awesome list of external links. It focuses on battle-tested mnemonics with detailed guidance, real-world scenarios, and proven pipelines.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\i Release v2.8 \u8212- 2026-01-26}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\i In PDF and DOCX, the table of contents and in-text links are clickable; use the TOC to jump to sections.}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Note:} This downloadable guide contains the core framework definitions. For real-world scenarios showing how frameworks chain together, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "../SCENARIOS.md"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
