{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u55357 ?\u56523 ? Real-world example:} {\i Production alert at 2 AM - Step back (don\u8217't panic), Take deep breath (reduce adrenaline), Observe (read alert details), Pull back perspective (assess severity before waking team), Then proceed to TRACE for diagnostics}\par}
