{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b \u55357 ?\u56481 ? When to use:} - Builds long-term resilience and confidence - Confidence connects to SHINE (positive self-image) - Use after PACE or ARIES for comprehensive stress management\par}
